%% CairoCore Planner — API + browser + OSRM
%% Preview: VS Code / Cursor "Mermaid" extension, or paste into GitHub markdown code fence.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Page as PlannerPage<br/>app/planner/page.tsx
    participant RecAPI as POST /api/planner/recommend
    participant StopsAPI as GET /api/planner/stops
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL
    participant RB as RouteBuilder +<br/>useRouteBuilderState
    participant Geo as navigator.geolocation
    participant OptAPI as POST /api/planner/optimize
    participant Osrm as fetchOsrmRoute
    participant OSRM as router.project-osrm.org

    User->>Page: Complete survey
    Page->>RecAPI: POST preferences
    RecAPI->>DB: findMany + scoring
    DB-->>RecAPI: places
    RecAPI->>RecAPI: getTopRecommendations
    RecAPI-->>Page: recommendations JSON
    Page->>Page: stage → selection

    User->>Page: Select places, continue
    alt coffee_shop or restaurant
        Page->>StopsAPI: GET ?type=…
        StopsAPI->>DB: findMany by type
        DB-->>StopsAPI: rows
        StopsAPI-->>Page: stop recommendations
    end
    Page->>Page: stage → route

    Page->>RB: Mount with selected places
    RB->>Geo: getCurrentPosition()
    Geo-->>RB: user lat/lng
    RB->>OptAPI: userLocation + stops
    Note over OptAPI: optimizeRouteFromLocation (server)
    OptAPI-->>RB: order indices

    User->>RB: Pick transport mode
    RB->>Osrm: fetchOsrmRoute(...)
    Osrm->>OSRM: GET /route/v1/{profile}/…
    OSRM-->>Osrm: distance, duration, geometry
    Osrm-->>RB: distanceKm, durationMinutes
